flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Ingest Transaction Payload]) --> ValidateSchema{Pydantic Schema\n& Bounds Check}

    ValidateSchema -->|Invalid / Out-of-Bounds| Reject422([Return HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity])
    ValidateSchema -->|Valid| CheckTimestamp{Timestamp Drift\nWithin +/- 300s?}

    CheckTimestamp -->|Drift Exceeded| FlagDrift[Flag TIMESTAMP_DRIFT_EXCEEDED]
    CheckTimestamp -->|Valid| MaskPII[Salt & Hash PII Identifiers]
    FlagDrift --> MaskPII

    MaskPII --> ExtractFeatures[Compute Haversine, Entropy & Query Cache Velocities]
    ExtractFeatures --> CheckTimeout{Execution Time\n> 120ms?}

    CheckTimeout -->|Yes: Timeout Exceeded| CircuitBreaker[Engage Heuristic Fallback Engine]
    CircuitBreaker --> FallbackDecision{Amount > $1000\nor Velocity > 5?}
    FallbackDecision -->|Yes| VerdictChallenge[Assign Verdict: CHALLENGE_MFA]
    FallbackDecision -->|No| VerdictApprove[Assign Verdict: APPROVE]

    CheckTimeout -->|No: Within SLA| RunDualModels[Execute LightGBM & Isolation Forest]
    RunDualModels --> CalcComposite[Compute S_composite = 0.70*P + 0.30*A]

    CalcComposite --> CheckZeroDay{P_supervised in [0.25, 0.45]\nand S_anomaly > 0.80?}
    CheckZeroDay -->|Yes: Novel Threat| VerdictChallenge

    CheckZeroDay -->|No: Standard Logic| CheckScoreTier{Composite Score\nThresholds}
    CheckScoreTier -->|S_composite < 0.30| VerdictApprove
    CheckScoreTier -->|0.30 <= S_composite <= 0.70| VerdictChallenge
    CheckScoreTier -->|S_composite > 0.70| VerdictBlock[Assign Verdict: BLOCK]

    VerdictApprove --> SkipXAI[Bypass Real-Time SHAP]
    VerdictChallenge --> ComputeXAI[Calculate SHAP TreeExplainer Local Attribution]
    VerdictBlock --> ComputeXAI

    ComputeXAI --> ExtractReasons[Generate Top-3 Human-Readable Reason Codes]
    ExtractReasons --> AppendLedger[Append SHA-256 Block to Cryptographic Ledger]
    SkipXAI --> AppendLedger

    AppendLedger --> ReturnResponse([Return HTTP 200 JSON Response <= 100ms])

